/apps/site/timeoutSeconds: static apps are files served by the edge, which has no time limit to set; remove "timeoutSeconds"
/apps/web/disk/..~1up: "../up" must be a folder inside the app's working directory, like "data" (no "..", "." or empty parts)
/apps/web/disk/data~1x: "data" and "data/x" overlap; list only the outer folder
